### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 52/100.** Evidence TB2.1 ~24% ; Tau3 ~9.3 ; GDPval 832; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 52/100.** Evidence GPQA 75.4 ; HLE 11.7 ; LCR ~52; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 72/100.** 262,144 native — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 15/100.** Text-only; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 58/100.** Evidence SWE ~52% ; SciCode ~32% ; BenchLM coding 31.5; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 100/100.** Free trial $0/$0 (30B/3B MoE).
- **Overall Score: 50/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (52+52+72+15+58)/5=49.8 → 50; best-fit per scoring methodology.

